 "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le04ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le04ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Regan</span>: Mmmm ... I love Italian food. Spaghetti is my favorite. It was a great choice.<br />\n<span class = \"strong\">Jane</span>: I enjoyed it too, and the garlic bread. Did you know that the first spaghetti came from China?<br />\n<span class = \"strong\" >Regan</span>: Really? You mean it doesn't have Italian origins?", "time": "7400"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jane</span>: No. Marco Polo brought it. He was a famous Italian explorer of the 13th century.<br />\n<span class = \"strong\">Regan</span>: That's interesting.</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jane</span>: He went all the way to China, and while he was there he tried Chinese spaghetti. He liked it so much that he brought it back with him to Italy.", "time": "27000"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Regan</span>: Marco Polo was smart. I like to learn about the past.</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jane</span>: I'm glad he liked spaghetti.", "time": "45000"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Regan</span>:  Would you like some dessert? Isn't having apple pie an American tradition?</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jane</span>:  Not tonight.  I am going to ask for the bill.  It's so noisy in here. I am getting a headache.", "time": "53500"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Regan</span>: Are you working tomorrow?</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jane</span>: Yes, but I finish at 3 p.m. Want to join me for a walk along the harbor tomorrow afternoon?</br>\n<span class = \"strong\">Regan</span>: Sounds good. I am going to be down that way anyway.", "time": "70000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le04ob04re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}